                title: "Linen Shirts: Your Ultimate Summer Companion",
                excerpt: "As temperatures rise, your wardrobe needs to adapt. Explore our collection of premium linen shirts designed to keep you cool, comfortable, and stylish throughout the summer months.",
                author: "Alex Morgan",
                authorImage: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519085360753-af0119f7cbe7?q=80&w=1974&auto=format&fit=crop",
