                title: "The Complete Guide to Formal Shirt Etiquette",
                date: "August 15, 2023"
            },
            {
                image: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1620799140408-edc6dcb6d633?q=80&w=1972&auto=format&fit=crop",
                title: "Understanding Fabric: A Buyer's Guide to Premium Shirts",
                date: "July 28, 2023"
            },
            {
                image: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593030761757-71fae45fa0e7?q=80&w=1974&auto=format&fit=crop",
